/*
 * Implements semantic verification for function and constructor prototypes.
 *
 * This module handles:
 *   - detection of infinite constructor redirection,
 *   - verification of allowed/forbidden attributes on functions, methods, and dtors,
 *   - detection of function definition collisions,
 *   - verification of declared vs. thrown exceptions,
 *   - verification of the `main` function signature,
 *   - structural comparison of function prototypes.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::symbol::function::verif
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/symbol/function/verif.yr
 * @Author(s):
